🔥Perfetto:

Perfetto is google system analytics and performance tool
it is one of  best tool for finding performance bottleneck slowStartup, ANR and HighCPU usage

🔸without perfetto
let your app take 2.5 sec to startUp
you only know app is slow

🔸with perfetto
it help to understand what app is doing over time

1-Application.onCreate() took 400 ms.
2-Dependency injection took 300 ms.
3- Room database initialization took 500 ms.
4- Main thread was blocked for 700 ms.
5- First frame was drawn after 2.5 s.



